read: app:doctrine-soulwinning~9335 | Pray the Lord of the harvest for labourers
read: app:doctrine-soulwinning~13892 | What fruit means
read: app:doctrine-soulwinning~15975 | Isaiah 61, the Christian's mission statement

=== Saved men sent to save men
# from 2709, 2762
--- Not angels, but men
kicker: Saved men sent to save men
lead: The angels and visions and even the glorified appearance of Jesus, none give the gospel but rather send saved men to preach the word and get other men saved.
panel: Saul and Ananias | While Jesus appeared and struck Saul blind, He doesn't give Saul the answer to what he must do, but rather a man must go to him and bring him to Christ. [[Acts 9:6]]
panel: Cornelius and Peter | An angel tells him to send men to bring Peter to him, that “*he shall tell thee what thou oughtest to do.*” [[Acts 10:5-6]]
take: It is by man acting as agents for God, a royal priesthood sharing the Gospel, that by hearing man may come to believe.

# from 2656
--- How can I, except some man guide me?
kicker: Saved men sent to save men
scripture: Acts 8:30-31 | mark: How can I, except some man should guide me
p: Philip asks the eunuch if he understands the scripture he's reading, and the reply is so true; unsaved people need saved people to explain scripture.
p: This is an excellent example of how God will move heaven and earth to get the gospel to someone earnestly contending for the truth that is written in every man's heart.

# from 10873, 15478
--- How shall they hear without a preacher?
kicker: Saved men sent to save men
scripture: Romans 10:14-15 | mark: how shall they hear without a preacher; How beautiful are the feet of them that preach the gospel of peace
p: The Spirit is ploughing the hearts and minds of the world. And so when Jesus says the harvest is plentiful, but the laborers few, he is talking to us.

# from 4115, 17793
--- Ambassadors for Christ
kicker: Saved men sent to save men
big: 2 Corinthians 5:20 | mark: Now then we are ambassadors for Christ
p: We are a new man, contained in the earthen vessels of the old, but reconciled with God in Jesus, and so, given the ministry, being a servant, to spreading that reconciliation to others. Ambassadors.
p: Every prayer for the lost is a prayer that the Spirit not only softens the heart of the unsaved, but that He also brings soulwinners into their lives to show them the gospel from scripture.
